項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete-ws1748911"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"source_reading_cases":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:source_review11-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"6je_hox_e7e","source_quote":"河南，匈奴種也。漢建武中，匈奴奴婢亡匿在涼州界雜種數千人，虜名奴婢為貲，一謂之「貲虜」。鮮卑慕容廆庶兄吐谷渾為氐王。在益州西北，亘數千里。其南界龍涸城，去成都千餘里。大戍有四，一在清水川，一在赤水，一在澆河，一在吐屈真川，皆子弟所治。其王治慕駕川。多畜，逐水草，無城郭。後稍為宮屋，而人民猶以氈廬百子帳為行屋。地常風寒，人行平沙中，沙礫飛起，行迹皆滅。肥地則有雀鼠同穴，生黃紫花；瘦地輒有鄣氣，使人斷氣，牛馬得之，疲汗不能行。","reading":"河南族源與慕容兄弟各據原說，後附地界、宮室、風俗。河南為此卷原題。","note":"河南族源與慕容兄弟各據原說，後附地界、宮室、風俗。河南為此卷原題。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p011","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":213,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete-ws1748911"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:variant_review11-46","kind":"variant_review","person_id":"6je_hox_e7e","source_quote":"慕容廆庶兄吐谷渾","reading":"前置族源敘述和慕容氏兄弟原語均保留，舊史意見另與魏書等互校。","note":"前置族源敘述和慕容氏兄弟原語均保留，舊史意見另與魏書等互校。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p011","start_codepoint":46,"end_codepoint":54,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete-ws1748911"}],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-qi059-tuyuhun-brother","subject_person_id":"1m1_db2_tx9","object_person_id":"6je_hox_e7e","predicate":"brother","qualifiers":{"source_term":"慕容廆庶兄吐谷渾"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-059","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-059-wester